 ],
 "synopsis": "Quadria Capital-backed Maxivision Eye Hospitals has confidentially filed for an initial public offering through Sebi's confidential route, taking its first formal step toward a public listing. The proposed offering includes a mix of newly issued shares and stock sold by existing investors. The company has appointed ICICI Securities and IIFL Capital as bankers for the transaction. Founded in 1996, Maxivision currently operates more than 90 centres across six states in India.",
